+| C7 — network: window scaling (RES-52) and the NIC/storage successor of RES-46 | ⬜ planned | `patches/RESIDUE3_C7_net.patch` |
+| C8 — Win32: the dynamic-scale loader, live FAIL-CLEAN receipts, DOOM D7 (RES-57/58/59) | ⬜ planned | `patches/RESIDUE3_C8_w32.patch` |
